    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Create test cases for Jira ticket {{ $json[\"Jira ID\"] }}. Follow these steps:\n\n1. Fetch the issue details from Jira using the ticket ID\n2. Analyze the requirements, description, and acceptance criteria\n3. Generate comprehensive test cases covering:\n   - Happy path scenarios\n   - Edge cases\n   - Negative test cases\n   - UI/UX validation\n\n4. For each test case, provide:\n   - Test Case ID (format: TC-XXX)\n   - Summary/Title\n   - Preconditions\n   - Test Steps (numbered)\n   - Expected Result\n   - Actual Result (leave empty)\n   - Status (set to \"Not Executed\")\n   - Priority (High/Medium/Low)\n   - Assignee (leave empty)\n   - Execution Date (leave empty)\n   - Comments/Notes\n\n5. Append each test case to the Google Sheet using the append/update tool",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a QA Test Case Generator. Your job is to:\n1. Fetch Jira issue details using the provided ticket ID\n2. Generate comprehensive test cases based on requirements\n3. Write each test case to Google Sheets\n\nAlways use the tools provided. Generate at least 5-10 test cases per ticket covering different scenarios."
        }
      },
